@startuml
title Activity lifecycle
[*] --> Waiting : create + group count
Waiting --> Waiting : authorize / load / confirm / join
Waiting --> Active : teacher start [mapping confirmed]
Active --> Active : valid submission / assign sequence\nreconnect original browser / join empty group
Active --> Ended : teacher end / freeze winners
Ended --> Ended : read results / writeback / verify
Ended --> Waiting : new activity ID [writeback settled]
note right of Ended
writing / pending block a new activity.
verified / conflict / failed are terminal.
idle means no write was started.
Unknown write outcome stays pending.
end note
Waiting --> Lost : process stopped
Active --> Lost : process stopped
Ended --> Lost : process stopped
Lost --> Waiting : create new activity with new ID
note right of Lost
Old activity ID is unavailable.
Old browser bindings cannot resume.
Existing writes in Google remain.
end note
@enduml
